rup</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>How to maintain a healthy body weight</article-title><source>Int J Vitam Nutr Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>208</fpage><lpage>215</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Astrup A (2006) How to maintain a healthy body weight. Int J Vitam Nutr Res 76:208&#x02013;215 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17243084</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Atzmon</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Gabriely</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Greiner</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidson</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Schechter</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Barzilai</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plasma HDL levels highly correlate with cognitive function in exceptional longevity</article-title><source>J Gerontol A Biol Sci Med Sci</source><year>2002</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>M712</fpage><lpage>M715</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Atzmon G, Gabriely I, Greiner W, Davidson D, Schechter C, Barzilai N (2002) Plasma HDL levels highly correlate with cognitive function in exceptional longevity. J Gerontol A Biol Sci Med Sci 57:M712&#x02013;M715 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12403798</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Atzmon</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Schechter</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Greiner</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidson</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rennert</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><